{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "core",
 "version": "3.2",
 "title": "core",
 "description": "The boot copier and the hook bus for the Digitone mk1 and Digitone Keys: every other mod needs it. From 2.1 also the voice note-on event, parameter slots, mod pages and project data, from 2.2 the Mod Menu (hold a track key), from 2.3 its grid of icons, from 3.0 the firmware locations mods use, as exports, so a mod that names only them builds for 1.43 and 1.44 alike, and from 3.1 what machines need: the voices' sound before the filter (ev_render_voices), stock parameters a mod relabels for its tracks (core_param_override), sound edits the voices hear (core_sound_set) and submenus in the Mod Menu, and from 3.2 exclusive audio: one mod may take the output from the master stage, with the voices muted if it likes (core_audio), the tempo (fw_tempo) and the MIDI CCs the unit receives, before the stock applies them (ev_midi_cc). On its own it changes nothing the unit does.",
 "category": "Framework",
 "author": "irpina",
 "license": "GPL-2.0-or-later",
 "target": {
  "device": "digitone-mk1",
  "product": "Digitone mk1",
